OL,5,G0115 John Lennon: Classic Albums
OL,6,     FA fascinating look at the making
OL,7,     Fof John Lennon's debut solo album,
OL,8,     FPlastic Ono Band, which saw the
OL,9,     Fformer Beatle dealing with issues
OL,10,     Fsuch as abandonment, class, love
OL,11,     Fand God.
OL,12,G0215 Eric Clapton: 24 Nights
OL,13,     FHighlights from Eric Clapton's
OL,14,     Frecord-setting run at The Royal
OL,15,     FAlbert Hall in 1990-1991, where he
OL,16,     Fperformed hits spanning his entire
OL,17,     Fcareer over 24 consecutive
OL,18,     Fsold-out nights.
